[TITLE]
InpWriter round-trip fixture: alternate flap-gate boolean spellings
[LOSSES] and [OUTFALLS] have always gone through Tokenizer::parse_boolean, which
accepts YES/TRUE/1, while [ORIFICES], [WEIRS] and [OUTLETS] tested a bare
to_upper(tok) == "YES" — so the same word meant different things depending on
which section it appeared in. Every gate here is spelled TRUE or 1 rather than
YES; the writer normalises them all back to YES.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
END_DATE             01/02/2020
END_TIME             00:00:00
REPORT_STEP          00:15:00
WET_STEP             00:05:00
DRY_STEP             01:00:00
ROUTING_STEP         0:00:30
MIN_SLOPE            0

[EVAPORATION]
CONSTANT   0.0
DRY_ONLY   NO

[JUNCTIONS]
;;Name  Elev  MaxDepth  InitDepth  SurDepth  Aponded
J1       12.0  5.0       0          0         0
J2       11.0  5.0       0          0         0

[OUTFALLS]
;;Name  Elev  Type  StageData  Gated
O1       9.0   FREE  *          1

[CONDUITS]
;;Name  FromNode  ToNode  Length  Roughness  InOffset  OutOffset
C1       J1        J2      300.0   0.013      0         0

[ORIFICES]
;;Name  FromNode  ToNode  Type  Offset  Cd    Gated  CloseTime
OR1      J2        O1      SIDE  0.5     0.65  TRUE   0

[WEIRS]
;;Name  FromNode  ToNode  Type        CrestHt  Cd    Gated  EC  Cd2  Sur
W1       J2        O1      TRANSVERSE  1.0      3.33  1      0   0    YES

[OUTLETS]
;;Name  FromNode  ToNode  Offset  Type             C1     C2    Gated
L1       J2        O1      0.0     FUNCTIONAL/HEAD  10.0   0.5   TRUE

[LOSSES]
;;Link  Kentry  Kexit  Kavg  FlapGate  Seepage
C1       0       0      0     TRUE      0

[XSECTIONS]
;;Link  Shape        Geom1  Geom2  Geom3  Geom4  Barrels
C1       CIRCULAR     2.0    0      0      0      1
OR1      RECT_CLOSED  1.0    1.0    0      0
W1       RECT_OPEN    1.0    2.0    0      0

[REPORT]
INPUT       NO
CONTROLS    NO
NODES       ALL
LINKS       ALL

[COORDINATES]
;;Node  X-Coord  Y-Coord
J1       0.0      0.0
J2       300.0    0.0
O1       600.0    0.0
